<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian cenbank allots 4.99 bln ats in 2-wk repos.</title>
<headline>Austrian cenbank allots 4.99 bln ats in 2-wk repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allotted 4.99 billion schillings in two-week repos at a fixed rate of 3.0 percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>The bank said it had met five percent of bids.</p>
<p>Last week the central bank allotted 10.28 billion schillings in two-week repos, meeting 12 percent of bids.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-254</p>
